cophants. In fact, he is so devoted to the Emperor that he was invited to a new, secret personal retreat on the Deep Core world of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Byss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Byss?action=edit&redlink=1"},". For weeks, Kithriss was the guest of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emperor Palpatine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emperor_Palpatine"},", but unknown to the Baron, the Emperor was secretly exposing him to a variety of Sith techniques intended to build up a resistance to Force powers. The conditioning will wear off in a matter of months, but while it lasts, the Baron's loyalty to Palpatine will remain at zealous levels.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Kithriss Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Bocce, High Galactic, Huttese, Kel Dor, Ryl\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Refl